# sigrok expect can-1: Data length code: 4
# sigrok expect can-1: CRC-15 sequence: 0x1459
# sigrok expect can-1: ACK slot: NACK
# sigrok expect can-1: End of frame
# sigrok expect can-1: Start of frame
